    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oggĕro</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">obg-</span></b> ), ĕre, v. a.
